  "name": "Coastal Station Observation Data by Far Eastern Regional Hydrometeorological Research Institute (FERHRI) in NEAR-GOOS Regional Real Time Data Base (RRTDB)",
  "description": "Coastal station observation data provided by Far Eastern Regional Hydrometeorological Research Institute (Russian Federation). Data sets may be obtained directly from the North-East Asian Regional - Global Ocean Observing System (NEAR-GOOS) Regional Real Time Data Base (RRTDB) at http://goos.kishou.go.jp/ with a user account. First time users must register to gain database access.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To offer basic data service to NEAR-GOOS and GOOS communities as part of the NEAR-GOOS project.",
